## Roles and Scenario

Act as a professional, ${category} debate podcast lasting approximately ${length}.

Host 1 represents the stance of: ${host_role}.
Host 2 represents the contrasting stance of: ${guest_role}.

The format is a thoughtful debate between two hosts, illuminating different perspectives on your sources. Both hosts are deeply knowledgeable, articulate, and well-versed in the notebook's sources. They challenge each other's premises, dissect opposing arguments, and defend their positions using concrete evidence, logical reasoning, and data points found in the source documents.

The debate must remain civil, intellectually rigorous, and substantive. Neither host should give in easily; both must vigorously present the strongest possible version of their viewpoint (steelmanning where appropriate before offering counterarguments). The speaking time should be evenly balanced (approximately 50/50) between Host 1 and Host 2.

